A wrapper type with both Unwrap and a custom Is: errors.Is(err, xerr.ErrRetryable)
{ return nil } on &xerr.TimeoutError{Err: doc.ErrDisk}. At run time Is always
matches, so nothing comes back. Custom Is methods are may-match by design (plan
S07). Expected 1 entry: doc.ErrDisk under *xerr.TimeoutError.Unwrap, marked
possibly handled (custom Is method of *xerr.TimeoutError).
